{"slug": "why-am-i-getting-leads-but-not-booking-jobs", "title": "Why Am I Getting Leads but Not Booking Jobs? | ScaleLocal", "description": "If leads come in but don’t turn into jobs, the problem is usually speed and follow-up — not lead quality. Here’s how to fix the conversion leak.", "card_blurb": "If leads come in but don’t become jobs, the leak is usually speed and follow-up — not lead quality.", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Why Am I Getting Leads but Not Booking Jobs? | ScaleLocal</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"If leads come in but don’t turn into jobs, the problem is usually speed and follow-up — not lead quality. Here’s how to fix the conversion leak.\">\n  <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.scalelocal.net/blog/why-am-i-getting-leads-but-not-booking-jobs/\">\n  <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.svg\">\n  <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"32x32\" href=\"/favicon-32.png\">\n  <link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\">\n  <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\">\n  <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"ScaleLocal\">\n  <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Why Am I Getting Leads but Not Booking Jobs? (The Real Reasons)\">\n  <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"If leads come in but don’t turn into jobs, the problem is usually speed and follow-up — not lead quality. Here’s how to fix the conversion leak.\">\n  <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.scalelocal.net/og-image.png\">\n  <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.scalelocal.net/blog/why-am-i-getting-leads-but-not-booking-jobs/\">\n  <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n  <meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://www.scalelocal.net/og-image.png\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" hre